# The json oracle (ADR-0015, ADR-0020): the 318 test_parsing files of JSONTestSuite at commit
# 1ef36fa01286573e846ac449e8683f8833c5b26a (MIT, Nicolas Seriot; see LICENSE-JSONTestSuite and NOTICE),
# each run as `-c . <file>`. Case id: json/<file name without .json>; its label is the prefix y_, n_ or i_.
# Expected outputs live in json.rec, written by scripts/oracle-record.sh only. Ids are immutable.
# A deviation case adds jqj's column of its DEVIATIONS.md row as jqj-* lines (ADR-0020); json.rec stays jq-ref's.

case json/i_number_double_huge_neg_exp
arg -c
filter .
arg i_number_double_huge_neg_exp.json
file i_number_double_huge_neg_exp.json [123.456e-789]
end

